WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.760
Ask PageGuide. Within seconds, PageGuide navigates to the right page, searches for the correct

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:14.920
dining options, and accurately annotates the closest cafe on the museum map. At the end,

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.879
it gives you a clear answer with annotated evidence, showing exactly where the nearest

00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:21.400
cafe appears on the webpage and in the screenshot.
